        "original_id": "8351ca3a-76a0-5d01-8485-1715c96a447c",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Josh Trank, Mike Valerio, Jeremy Slater, Simon Kinberg, Miles Teller, Michael B. Jordan, Kate Mara, Jamie Bell, Toby Kebbell, Reg E. Cathey\n- Works: Fantastic Four (2015 film), The Wire, Oz, House of Cards\n- Roles: film director, screenwriter, editor, writer, producer, director, executive, actor\n- Awards: Emmy Award nominations, Emmy Award win\n\nFacts:\n- Josh Trank, born on February 19, 1984, is an American film director, screenwriter, and editor.\n- Mike Valerio is an award-winning writer, producer, director, and executive with more than 20 years in the entertainment industry.\n- Fantastic Four (2015 film) was directed by Josh Trank, and Josh Trank co-wrote the screenplay with Jeremy Slater and Simon Kinberg.\n- Fantastic Four (2015 film) stars Miles Teller, Michael B. Jordan, Kate Mara, Jamie Bell, and Toby Kebbell.\n- Reg E. Cathey is known for playing Norman Wilson in The Wire, Martin Querns in Oz, Dr. Franklin Storm in the 2015 Fantastic Four reboot, and Freddy Hayes in House of Cards.\n- Reg E. Cathey received three consecutive Emmy Award nominations for Outstanding Guest Actor in a Drama Series for House of Cards, including a win in 2015.",
